        "fr-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "d403ea21-f327-3553-ac65-c0e74f8430da",
                "word": "salissure",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "cde78f4e-b315-4c0d-a80c-2736d281c8ac",
                        "entry_id": "d403ea21-f327-3553-ac65-c0e74f8430da",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "salissures"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "0f4ccd21-f5f0-3cec-a8aa-d69df0eac02f",
                        "entry_id": "d403ea21-f327-3553-ac65-c0e74f8430da",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Souillure, ce qui rend une chose sale."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "5e00ff40-e8b8-4479-a01d-809744d282ef",
                                "sense_id": "0f4ccd21-f5f0-3cec-a8aa-d69df0eac02f",
                                "text": "J’examinais les chevelures, le teint, les yeux, les sourires ; j’y cherchais des comparaisons persuasives qui pourraient nuire au souvenir si parfait de Madeleine. Je n’avais plus qu’une idée, l’impétueuse envie de me soustraire quand même à la persécution de ce souvenir unique. Je l’avilissais à plaisir et le déshonorais, espérant par là le rendre indigne d’elle et m’en débarrasser par des salissures."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c7cb07f0-0c54-4896-9685-77b61b42a28d",
                                "sense_id": "0f4ccd21-f5f0-3cec-a8aa-d69df0eac02f",
                                "text": "Tout ce qui précède mon mariage prend dans mon souvenir cet aspect de pureté ; contraste, sans doute, avec cette ineffaçable salissure des noces."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1a67a3a2-eb57-428c-978a-7cbd980a98be",
                                "sense_id": "0f4ccd21-f5f0-3cec-a8aa-d69df0eac02f",
                                "text": "… sa grande qualité serait de dégrader les salissures sous l’effet de la lumière."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "4dfe47c9-a904-41cc-a725-8a00c4194ce0",
                        "source_entry_id": "d403ea21-f327-3553-ac65-c0e74f8430da",
                        "source_sense_id": "0f4ccd21-f5f0-3cec-a8aa-d69df0eac02f",
                        "target_lang_word": "defilement",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "defilement",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4dfa5d7d-3ac0-3046-a4a9-acd8133fb592",
                                        "entry_id": "35aa7dae-5745-3c44-ad60-18e44c66a51a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The act of defiling."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0d496a9f-2c16-4fa4-969d-9cb3b3a4b486",
                                                "sense_id": "4dfa5d7d-3ac0-3046-a4a9-acd8133fb592",
                                                "text": "Time has taken a terrible revenge upon mankind for his despoliation of the valleys and his defilement of the mountains, yet the industries and the railways of South Wales still put the bravest front upon an outlook which all may hope is becoming less saddening and less grim."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "aad28e32-ccb3-4345-ba24-f326cca1dede",
                                                "sense_id": "4dfa5d7d-3ac0-3046-a4a9-acd8133fb592",
                                                "text": "The new law also applies to acts of defilement besides burning, such as publicly ripping a flag up. Public display of the Nazi swastika and other Nazi symbols is already banned in Germany."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8e5b7d76-2d5e-306f-96d9-b42a6c94fdce",
                                        "entry_id": "35aa7dae-5745-3c44-ad60-18e44c66a51a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The state of being defiled."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4c0087d4-1e50-3edf-b983-4daa442b40c1",
                                        "entry_id": "35aa7dae-5745-3c44-ad60-18e44c66a51a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The protection of the interior walls of a fortification from enfilading fire, as by covering them, or by a high parapet on the exposed side."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "7c60d5b0-21d8-4937-b6f7-9285b12b8bdf",
                        "source_entry_id": "d403ea21-f327-3553-ac65-c0e74f8430da",
                        "source_sense_id": "0f4ccd21-f5f0-3cec-a8aa-d69df0eac02f",
                        "target_lang_word": "vervuiling",
                        "target_lang_code": "nl",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "vervuiling",
                                "target_lang_code": "nl",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b6597f6a-3c1c-31d5-9420-35d5b26e41f5",
                                        "entry_id": "f1ce0c20-2564-371b-ba02-06de73618382",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "sterke verontreiniging"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2694c663-b19f-432c-abb8-6d917e08feb4",
                                                "sense_id": "b6597f6a-3c1c-31d5-9420-35d5b26e41f5",
                                                "text": "b.v. het terechtkomen van onnatuurlijke, schadelijke of giftige stoffen in het milieu"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1db31e58-effb-4a7a-acfe-8cb6b5aed494",
                                                "sense_id": "b6597f6a-3c1c-31d5-9420-35d5b26e41f5",
                                                "text": "Dat milieuvervuiling een probleem is, werd rond 1970 algemeen bekend."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "58c53ddd-9fda-4c13-9a21-ca8183d6e7c9",
                                                "sense_id": "b6597f6a-3c1c-31d5-9420-35d5b26e41f5",
                                                "text": "Vandaag wordt bij verschillende Nederlandse vliegvelden gedemonstreerd door mensen die vinden dat de overlast en de vervuiling door de luchtvaart de spuigaten uit loopt."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e57f792d-efca-468c-9e00-0730cdf27877",
                                                "sense_id": "b6597f6a-3c1c-31d5-9420-35d5b26e41f5",
                                                "text": "\"We willen bezoekers laten zien hoe kwetsbaar het waddengebied is\", zegt Venema. \"Met vervuiling, gaswinning en druk op de natuur is er veel werk te doen. In het nieuwe centrum kunnen we dat verhaal beter vertellen.\""
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "23b51637-6be0-4ba7-af19-2a15a638123b",
                        "source_entry_id": "d403ea21-f327-3553-ac65-c0e74f8430da",
                        "source_sense_id": "0f4ccd21-f5f0-3cec-a8aa-d69df0eac02f",
                        "target_lang_word": "afval",
                        "target_lang_code": "nl",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "afval",
                                "target_lang_code": "nl",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e72b4e9f-b438-39cc-9d6c-fdac25784ef9",
                                        "entry_id": "34b84ade-492c-3b1c-825b-2c1dc21c7b32",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "onbruikbare resten die weggegooid worden"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a1469735-1b0d-461e-a6a6-8217fdf47c1e",
                                                "sense_id": "e72b4e9f-b438-39cc-9d6c-fdac25784ef9",
                                                "text": "Morgen komen ze het afval ophalen."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ae87c560-1556-482b-9e52-2f17187a1c41",
                                                "sense_id": "e72b4e9f-b438-39cc-9d6c-fdac25784ef9",
                                                "text": "Doordat ik vaak dagenlang geen afvalbak tegenkwam, droeg ik altijd een zak vol gebruikte wc-papiertjes bij me. Het was altijd weer een enorme opluchting om in een dorpje mijn wc-papier en ander afval weg te kunnen gooien."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fd28333b-159b-4e59-bfc3-6fd3b73da78b",
                                                "sense_id": "e72b4e9f-b438-39cc-9d6c-fdac25784ef9",
                                                "text": "‘Wie heeft dat ook alweer gezegd? Over dat afval?’ kreunde ze. ‘Welk afval?’‘Dat de geschiedenis neerkomt op een berg afval die op je neerdondert.’"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "afval",
                                "target_lang_code": "nl",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9b4e0e7d-7b64-31a7-940d-e96a8d9bdf7e",
                                        "entry_id": "9bfa68eb-45fa-32b0-837d-9faeece5e95b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "het afvallen, verlating van een persoon of overtuiging waaraan men eerder was toegewijd"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3be708b7-3ce2-4eb7-a69b-9b31c2520dfe",
                                                "sense_id": "9b4e0e7d-7b64-31a7-940d-e96a8d9bdf7e",
                                                "text": "De grondtoon van het boek getuigt van een cultuurpessimisme, dat vooral tot uiting komt in wantrouwen jegens een volledig geseculariseerde samenleving. De afval van God lijkt vanuit een gelovig gezichtspunt betekenis te hebben, maar dat is volgens hem een vergissing."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "afval",
                                "target_lang_code": "nl",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "921201fe-e585-389b-acbe-05e9fb5ce56a",
                                        "entry_id": "c0a9add1-8ce8-33d3-916c-601f2e120f0a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "eerste persoon enkelvoud tegenwoordige tijd van afvallen"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "form-of",
                                            "with-subordinate-clause"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a5aa5ea3-3ea9-433b-9cca-2df43034940c",
                                                "sense_id": "921201fe-e585-389b-acbe-05e9fb5ce56a",
                                                "text": "... dat ik afval."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
